<title>FRANCE: Reuters 11th ex-Paris air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 11th ex-Paris air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are current average ex-Paris French franc air cargo rates per kilo for a 100kg shipment with volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>				 Feb 7	  Jan 8</p>
<p>			  NORTH AMERICA</p>
<p> PAR-JFK			 5.40	   5.40</p>
<p> PAR-CHI			 5.75	   5.75</p>
<p> PAR-LAX			 6.55	   6.55</p>
<p> PAR-YMX (Montreal)	  6.70	   6.65</p>
<p>			  ASIA/PACIFIC</p>
<p> PAR-SEL			11.30	  11.30</p>
<p> PAR-NAR			15.00	  15.00</p>
<p> PAR-TPE			 8.00	   8.00</p>
<p> PAR-HKG			 8.50	   8.50</p>
<p> PAR-SIN			 8.20	   8.20</p>
<p> PAR-NOU (New Caledonia)  40.15	  40.15</p>
<p> PAR-PPT (Tahiti)	   33.60	  33.60</p>
<p>			  MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> PAR-DXB			 5.25	   5.25</p>
<p>			  INDIAN OCEAN</p>
<p> PAR-RUN (Reunion)	  21.30	  21.30</p>
<p>			  FRENCH WEST INDIES</p>
<p> PAR/FDF/PTP		  15.00	  15.00</p>
<p>			  AFRICA</p>
<p> PAR-JNB			14.00	  14.10</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smalle agents based at the Paris airports.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in French francs.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
